  "id": 937,
  "description": "## ✨ Welcome to Lacuna ✨\n\nWe&#039;re not just a guild, we&#039;re a team looking for people who want to be part of building something great together. We&#039;re focused on collaboration and teamwork, with members contributing to shared goals and making decisions as a group. Your voice matters here! 🗣️\n\n### 💬 What We&#039;re About\n\nWe play together, help each other, and grow as a team! We welcome contributors from all countries and nationalities. Feel free to ask questions, join raids, and enjoy the game with everyone! 🌍\n\n- Idle is a lifestyle 🌴\n- Discord is our primary method of communication, as a collaborative guild, we have polls and discussions to make decisions together. You must be part of the discord server to get announcements and guild info!\n- Come fight alongside us! ⚔️\n\n\n### 📅 Pool Time (Sunday-Saturday)\n\n##### The main Lacuna guild is focused on assaults (collaboration with guild-mates) and character progression (individual growth). \nWe regularly pool throughout the day (sometimes more than once or twice) to align with World Bosses and allow for members of all time zones to obtain the buffs. We utilize an in-house built in system called Lacuna Sanctum that pings groups on Discord with notices!\n\n##### What about Raids?\nOur main team doesn&#039;t raid normally, but during events, often times we run 3 raids per day for those who want some tokens!\n\n### ⚔️ Assaults (Saturday)\n\nDuring our normal event time of ⌚ 7:00 AM PST | 10:00 AM EST ⌚we have a scheduled assault. Assaults are predetermined weekly for us to compete for seasonal buffs.\n\n### ⭐️Benefits\n- Lacuna Sanctum - A in-house built tool with tons of in-game resources, simulators, guild tracking, alerts and more!\n- A community of helpful and fun people to chat and work towards common guild goals.\n- A Growth Guild System to learn and start from level 1 to eventually becoming powerful!\n- Teleportation to our guildhall location (discounted teleports).\n- Energizing Pool! Regular use of a buff!\n- Active participation in Conquests!\n\n### ✔️ Requirements\n\n- Combat Level: +92 💪\n- Daily Activity: Idle ≠ AFK. Help with daily challenges! Chat and hang out in Discord to make new friends. If you&#039;re inactive without telling anyone for over a week, you may be kicked.\n\n### 🏘️ Lacuna Community \n- Are you a lower combat level but still want to be part of this awesome crew? Come chat on our discord!\n     - Lacuna - CL92+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=937\n     - Lacunae Echo - CL80+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1115\n     - Tiny Lacunas - CL60+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1442\n     - Lacuna Academy - CL40+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1536\n     - Lacuna Resort - Retired/Snoozers : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1516\n\n🏰 Ready to join a community where your contributions make a real difference? All are welcome on our Discord to come say hi! 👇\n\n##### https://discord.gg/DQvSQNkPbp",
